{%- if action == "succeeded" -%}
As requested, your order {{ o.order_id }} has been cancelled. Any payment made will be refunded to your original payment method.
{%- elif action == "failed" -%}
We couldn't cancel order {{ o.order_id }} automatically. A colleague will look into it and confirm with you.
{%- elif action == "held" and cancellable -%}
We can cancel order {{ o.order_id }} for you.
{%- elif not cancellable -%}
Order {{ o.order_id }} has already shipped, so it can no longer be cancelled.{% if returnable %} Once it's delivered, you can request a return within {{ policy.returns.window_days }} days.{% endif %}
{%- endif -%}
